  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "302期封面作品名稱：風中ê名字"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgvbcVwl4ny38Cgcg-wHtTzw5JiqZmqZTa3bIdCpbUfvg_vVaU8giZWhuGf0vkzBwqWAhFW6lEHPD10lhNmk_ISBvlMbIk78dZLrlCJ7k9DBiOSkTNYseOFFKELTC4YVRN50s-GBDF1EHla/s1600/%25E9%25A2%25A8%25E4%25B8%25AD%25E7%259A%2584%25E5%2590%258D%25E5%25AD%259707%2528180+cm+x+240cm%2529.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1175\" data-original-width=\"1600\" height=\"470\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgvbcVwl4ny38Cgcg-wHtTzw5JiqZmqZTa3bIdCpbUfvg_vVaU8giZWhuGf0vkzBwqWAhFW6lEHPD10lhNmk_ISBvlMbIk78dZLrlCJ7k9DBiOSkTNYseOFFKELTC4YVRN50s-GBDF1EHla/s640/%25E9%25A2%25A8%25E4%25B8%25AD%25E7%259A%2584%25E5%2590%258D%25E5%25AD%259707%2528180+cm+x+240cm%2529.jpg\" width=\"640\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n</div>\n<b><br /></b>\n<b><br /></b><br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b><b>作品名稱</b></b></div>\n<br />\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n風中ê名字</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b>作品簡介</b></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTī台灣tsit塊土地，有tsiânn濟二二八kap白色恐怖受難ê人，陳武鎮用厚重ê油畫顏料，畫出台灣ê風景，尤其是火燒島ê礁岩、海湧，油畫顏料中摻入粗沙、砂石、燒磁用ê熟料、柴hu...，hōo風景中ê山岩、風雲、海水，感覺更加沉重。畫面中mā有玻璃珠ê破片，呈現土地ê碎裂。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n受難者ê名字，一个一个，一字一字，用細枝筆聊聊仔寫tī畫面；</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n有--ê tī空中，隨風飄動，</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n有--ê tī雲--裡，ná有ná無，</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n有--ê tī山岩頂，陷落石縫，</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n有--ê tī海湧中，有時浮有時沉。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nTsit系列ê作品，陳武鎮有畫13件，因為beh寫濟濟ê名字，畫面lóng相當大，像tsit幅就有一个大人ê kuân度。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n《風中ê名字》系列ê名稱是tuì一首陳武鎮ê詩來--ê：</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n大地無言</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n只有風吹--過</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n名字飛--過</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n今年吹--過ê風</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n明年ē koh吹--來</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n風中</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\nIáu ē有諸君ê名字</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b>材質</b></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n油畫</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b>尺寸</b></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n180cm X 240cm</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b>年代</b></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n2009年</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<b>作者簡介</b></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n陳武鎮，1949年出世，屏東縣萬巒鄉佳佐村人。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n1969年tuì台南師專美勞組畢業，tī海軍做兵ê時，tsiânn做白色恐怖受難者，tī台東泰源監獄坐牢兩冬。出獄後補做兵，回復美勞教職，2004年tuì新營國小退休，全力投入人權畫作kap木雕ê創作。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n2007年出版《夢回泰源》油畫集，2008年出版《虛擬巨惡》油畫集，2010年 出版《風中的名字》、《山》油畫集，2011年出版《判決書》油畫集，2012年出版《消失的家人》《爪與牙》《刑求》一套三冊油畫集，2014年設計製造「泰源事件紀念碑」，2017年出版《那一場雪》油畫、木雕作品集。伊用藝術創作來表現對人權ê關心、對公義ê追求kap對暴政ê抗訴。</div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgywYPD6fk9-xPNkgepbXSK7HHk_XaLwdjfkIjuV5bpk0kKdkhhG4t4UnkVezD2aMqZBP6r-KU_KwVhCDmkNUOa7i5Fcunqdef4mu4YejyoZ3vTT3AZZd5beaItseWvpteFeraqA7dAEQw2/s1600/302%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1421\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"320\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgywYPD6fk9-xPNkgepbXSK7HHk_XaLwdjfkIjuV5bpk0kKdkhhG4t4UnkVezD2aMqZBP6r-KU_KwVhCDmkNUOa7i5Fcunqdef4mu4YejyoZ3vTT3AZZd5beaItseWvpteFeraqA7dAEQw2/s320/302%25E5%258F%25B0%25E6%2596%2587%25E9%2580%259A%25E8%25A8%258ABONG%25E5%25A0%25B1_%25E5%25B0%2581%25E9%259D%25A2.jpg\" width=\"225\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\">\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n--------------------------------------------<br />\n<br /></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">歡迎捐款贊助　李江却台語文教基金會　（捐款thang抵稅，匯款了後請通知02-23112199）</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(定期定額)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" href=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2FfF5bhx&amp;h=AT1fIGbvLe-H1RfIAEmaBwSoHSud2mWn8lrfo0xPDXLyCEJ6_oyPKdt-VNpBwe2ie9QCjJZfObjdC0zbQCynJ54D2Wi_b8ZrVcDWstK8-oYv8FmldyEJo_KdoHuWC05sSueoTuSvJ5cr-p_vScPimOGX4wzN4y0tm93TSYPwa_Oy3MkFQCQALsRTZFMOuwZl3PJcYWBoT4jwc6LmmvFHGmEYyMh57UFUGaQo8oSSuqcQD7MKG6wLN7MfjP3hZh1vLhHapsOOcRjYmtcIPyZgahNTgWaTFPQekTNcLnwDRhPn5DUPgyHeN0NWy-eAvWaf1orAzEnaT0bXGSBh6WL5ZAg_4sea_VdaRcccV0V-eEdDhNVVJKe0z-BljR9iJL_jWIDn2Jg-L_StZx71NBmaz7xd3VsLzNHGj2fO28pTvMz9QEOhl9nJrC80TCbPW5QlyDfD0ZK9o_8n3YOoDoX6PLV_4rNk2cvzW43qFquAkjfncrxhxCKH-VY6Kf7T3qxnHFKyq5jaEBd-Gzbx3BOuAS0L2ZAq5p4l1ciYXkt6XOQM7lnaWciPYKDMH73hsYXjsMWMXsK2AWmIxmqDhr3wrIhYsOOwJNPzsMyjmPbI9ddmSRJ_pqcuxGjmrXlJMqFxxpVrD6GXJGkN7wZj5MfSb2YRcg\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fF5bhx</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">線上捐款(單筆)&nbsp;<a data-ft=\"{&quot;tn&quot;:&quot;-U&quot;}\" data-lynx-mode=\"async\" data-lynx-uri=\"https://l.facebook.com/l.php?u=https%3A%2F%2Fppt.cc%2Ffcycox&amp;h=AT0H6xWALxkqKTZY4xK9Odg526LM77N2q_ltt_Y8nC4_ki5ZoWyAjPPNaKyF6_djXJ_obDEOkx__7WMdaTUsGNOmfg_FDe_nfhDB9cW9M2iyHMHquKL9nqCFMpuMwCF5Gby8kOWjHu6nBgAoYPsZcF2smrFzZVzSNSg15gjibmTXy4sSPf6SrWMQHmUCH9xNvWH_NU1Wp9NzumavCiqfcj4T6os_JW-iktTbi7Rur82KNucjaugBeLf4yIkaMCU_vybvXjKVnWWUq5pAwuVuMCebZdM-rH__LgvZR9zWIlivnX_lBELOjpKo7-lDzasSyJI8UDxgBUsDYSi-TXAqb1moHrcCZPU9DgyiIg0Dl63KER-NQMuehP5AjqLfKITfoVoc9ZXFfr-BItslSWP-mplFEqq82MBwmXwrembzOg-5Qu2qNvQfpLqoI5tvIIN0U_ZNfMHNfcND0dHoyuXmvOdmELx6ODOh4GLkH8uxKdg8hAgwf6LsFQVFWT-8hoopqCulWayrSYRFDyon9I6G-w1eBkO9iWtohOpq8XEA05uL2v6-oh4pTr5QYdobVfeqArrNaSvWLrvE4cL1ci5n7zIes4NNv3dRAAgdx4wRiKX-0e6xJla9fe2ZTCOTyQsZEuUGrdmWYe2l7e4iCwc\" href=\"https://ppt.cc/fcycox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"cursor: pointer; font-family: inherit;\" target=\"_blank\">https://ppt.cc/fcycox</a></span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">有固定的長期捐款， 讓更多的台語文相關計畫可以穩定的推行，感謝逐家。</span></div>\n<div style=\"background-color: white; font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</span><br />\n<span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: x-small;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</span><br />\n<div style=\"font-size: 15px;\">\n<span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><br /></span></div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\"><br /></span></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"font-family: &quot;times new roman&quot;;\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: x-small;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<br />\n<br />"
